# 懵然不知

(pos:動詞片語)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道、冇察覺到發生咗啲乜嘢事。形容一個人好懵，對身邊嘅事一無所知。
eng:to be completely unaware of something; to have no idea about what is happening
<eg>
yue:佢成日掛住打機，對屋企發生嘅事懵然不知。 (keoi5 sing4 jat6 gwaa3 zyu6 daa2 gei1, deoi3 uk1 kei2 faat3 sang1 ge3 si6 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:He is always playing video games and is completely unaware of what is happening at home.
</eg>
</explanation> [end of text]


